{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":541042,\"title\":\"Aura\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"A couple discovers a Kirlian Photography apparatus in their new house. Intrigued by the concept of photographing peoples' Auras they unwittingly release an ancient evil. Only the local psychic can help and she knows far more than she reveals.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/u0sbU4fz0V6sN98wuh5UehFl7Nw.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kQx7ic6w6p1Ypfc0eXfycKRT69X.jpg\",\"rating\":3.4,\"voteCount\":36,\"year\":2018,\"runtime\":82,\"genres\":[\"Horror\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"NL\",\"name\":\"Netherlands\"},{\"code\":\"GB\",\"name\":\"United Kingdom\"}],\"budget\":1000000,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Steve Lawson\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":2114488,\"name\":\"Steve Lawson\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":126429,\"name\":\"Shane Taylor\",\"character\":\"Mitch\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rwXiIL1uRNsvQYj2KncbUxNctn.jpg\"},{\"id\":69467,\"name\":\"Rula Lenska\",\"character\":\"Ada\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4lgQ8AIVaQQxgLnl097PRMu8pp8.jpg\"},{\"id\":1596698,\"name\":\"Denise Moreno\",\"character\":\"Karen\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kyPzoLqaaNQoROMqJeEThlzT9Se.jpg\"},{\"id\":1952386,\"name\":\"Jeanine Nerissa Sothcott\",\"character\":\"Diane\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qthIdxclGoun59DZSF84b6yGJ65.jpg\"},{\"id\":91974,\"name\":\"Jane MacFarlane\",\"character\":\"Elaine\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":544368,\"name\":\"Steven Dolton\",\"character\":\"Uncle Alexander\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gasqjjem0LVLdXmM9wtEkZ0zMdF.jpg\"},{\"id\":1144559,\"name\":\"Jay Sutherland\",\"character\":\"Simms\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":3531422,\"name\":\"Freyja Green\",\"character\":\"Young Karen\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":1339713,\"title\":\"Obsession\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bRwnj8WEKBCvmfeUNOukJPwB43K.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5lTZyuBTNOfawsfPT8Q0cIg6qAF.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After breaking the mysterious \\\"One Wish Willow\\\" to win his crush's heart, a hopeless romantic finds himself getting exactly what he asked for but soon discovers that some desires come at a dark, sinister price.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1368314,\"title\":\"Passenger\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2sOEJzhPzjTkZSlPbGxOJ7xgIyS.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iyW6c3kvzFo37Gi0BJgr5EBh8a.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After a young couple witnesses a gruesome highway accident, they soon realize they did not leave the crash scene alone, as a demonic presence called the Passenger that won't stop until it claims them both turns their van life adventure into a nightmare.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1242011,\"title\":\"Together\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/80slKYVM5teFH3kz6ouWrZXveqj.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/39Niij05MXfibXBsHiUU0Ml0POX.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Years into their relationship, Tim and Millie find themselves at a crossroads as they move to the country, abandoning all that is familiar in their lives except each other. With tensions already flaring, a nightmarish encounter with a mysterious, unnatural force threatens to corrupt their lives, their love, and their flesh.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":13510,\"title\":\"Eden Lake\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tOg6ElTe1mJwaCFN0172U4oso22.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/s9v1QZMVhwShQ7415jPhtfqzyjG.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When a young couple goes to a remote wooded lake for a romantic getaway, their quiet weekend is shattered by an aggressive group of local kids. Rowdiness quickly turns to rage as the teens terrorize the couple in unimaginable ways, and a weekend outing becomes a bloody battle for survival.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1302916,\"title\":\"Heart Eyes\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ebqttF1Vjgde6uSFBEw9mta7Hd3.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vh5FIqfosYaLWxCmZfSPjgUWWfn.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When the \\\"Heart Eyes Killer\\\" strikes Seattle, a pair of co-workers pulling overtime on Valentine's Day are mistaken for a couple by the elusive couple-hunting killer. Now, they must spend the most romantic night of the year running for their lives.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Romance\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1288072,\"title\":\"Keeper\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mbGHijUc0C3fcM12l6ro6FgxIvg.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8GjH1BU5PtoqAlhMeXQ46eq9z1D.jpg\",\"rating\":5.7,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Liz and Malcolm escape for a romantic anniversary weekend at a secluded cabin. When Malcolm suddenly returns to the city, Liz finds herself isolated and in the presence of an unspeakable evil that reveals the cabin's horrifying secrets.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":788929,\"title\":\"Lamb\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gP9yviboTGWGolqUZKIB1UkF1C2.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/96uOMED23ZLBtb0HQQ5Urr3qMRp.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An Icelandic couple live with their herd of sheep on a beautiful but remote farm. When they discover a mysterious newborn on their land, they decide to keep it and raise it as their own. This unexpected development and the prospects of a new family brings them much joy before ultimately destroying them.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":901385,\"title\":\"Significant Other\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/liGvBdUsyOfiTJjNCD55JJfISzb.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dR78i8aMsa8wIuBiHGfU8K5gNL7.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Ruth and Harry decide to take a romantic backpacking trip through the Pacific Northwest, but amongst the beautiful scenery, Ruth makes an unexpected discovery that sets her off on a strange, frightening new path. The couple aren't alone in the woods, and they might not be the same when they come out...if they come out.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Mystery\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1088157,\"title\":\"Godless: The Eastfield Exorcism\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nfSrMW6ooScsf3PRa0ZSjbch8ed.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qvuJpcFl1P2LPOFtcUks6G44aSQ.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Lara is a woman tormented, torn between science and faith. Pushed by her husband to seek treatment from a congregation of zealots, a ruthless exorcist will try to save her soul by putting an innocent woman through hell.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":786300,\"title\":\"Tentacles\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rRfcH0jg9X8czKJhXCnny45NSWt.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iID0at69rWzZOIarUIFrfDOFJA.jpg\",\"rating\":5.8,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A young Los Angeles couple Tara and Sam fall head over heels into a new romance, entwining their lives—until their intimacy transforms into something terrifying.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Romance\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1263112,\"title\":\"Kang Mak from Pee Mak\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/h2k58PFM2dQsHXNxb2D471r3BJp.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/llRefT6VaLgyI60g4KyJeZe1xzD.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Returning home with his friends, a soldier reunites with his wife, not knowing she's become a ghost. But her death's not the end of their love story.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Horror\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":705396,\"title\":\"Separation\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lsT1Yl6GYcxYDVWJ3m8egMrK8mI.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3GJR0YEPquNDrEYC0YuOYZPr9AU.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"On the final night of a heated divorce, a husband and wife acquire a strange new disease.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"7ymPpmYg1j0\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}